# Housing batch b: step 7b (housing, the mortgage annuity, no DC) renters and
# owners separately, and step 12 (the DC pot, no housing), on the CPU:
# retirement inputs, 8,192 households a step, 1,500 steps, learning rate 3e-3
# (3e-4 after 1,000), the consumption share starting at 0.5. The joint
# network of step 7b is housing_cpu_b_joint.jobs, with the same settings.
# Run: OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=3 JULIA_FLAGS=--heap-size-hint=2500M bash neural/scripts/queue.sh neural/jobs/housing_cpu_b.jobs 4
step7b_renter testset_7b_renter_quick.mat variants=ret_n8192_lr3e-3_k1500 device=cpu
step7b_owner  testset_7b_owner_quick.mat  variants=ret_n8192_lr3e-3_k1500 device=cpu
step12_ret    testset_12_nohousing_fine.mat variants=ret_n8192_lr3e-3_k1500 device=cpu
